Source landscape: The 2023 documentary universe is broad and politically contested, spanning official Vietnamese laws and statistics, UN treaty materials, foreign-government reports, international and local NGOs, specialist archives, and reporting on detention, police abuse, protest, minority violence, environmentalist prosecutions, and anti-corruption enforcement. Search coverage included English and Vietnamese queries across these source families. Search results remain leads only; no evidence claims or judgments are made.

